{"id": "grade5_simple_circuit_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade5_simple_circuit.md", "grade": "5", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade5_simple_circuit", "tags": ["core", "grade5_simple_circuit", "电路"], "text": "# 五年级 简单电路\n一个简单电路通常由电池、导线、用电器（如小灯泡）和开关组成。\n只有当电路连接成一个完整回路时，电流才能流动，小灯泡才会亮。\n如果其中一处断开，小灯泡就不会亮。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade3_weather_changes_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade3_weather_changes.md", "grade": "3", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade3_weather_changes", "tags": ["core", "grade3_weather_changes", "天气", "水循环", "蒸发", "降水"], "text": "# 三年级 天气变化\n天气会变化，常见的天气有晴天、阴天、雨天和多云。\n下雨通常和水循环有关。太阳会把地面上的水晒热，水会蒸发成水蒸气。水蒸气升到空中后遇冷，会变成很多小水滴。这些小水滴聚在一起形成云。当云里的小水滴越来越多、越来越重时，就会落下来，变成雨。\n观察天气时，可以看天空、云、风和降水情况。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade4_light_shadow_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade4_light_shadow.md", "grade": "4", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade4_light_shadow", "tags": ["core", "grade4_light_shadow", "影子"], "text": "# 四年级 光与影\n光通常沿直线传播。当不透明的物体挡住光时，物体后面会形成影子。\n影子的方向和光源的位置有关。\n影子的长短会随着光源位置的变化而变化。\n早上和傍晚，影子常常比较长；中午，影子会短一些。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade4_water_cycle_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade4_water_cycle.md", "grade": "4", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade4_water_cycle", "tags": ["core", "grade4_water_cycle", "凝结", "水循环", "蒸发", "降水"], "text": "# 四年级 水循环\n水循环是指地球上的水在蒸发、凝结、降水等过程中不断循环。\n蒸发是液态水变成水蒸气的过程。\n凝结是水蒸气遇冷变成小水滴的过程。\n当云中的小水滴越来越多、越来越重时，就会形成降水。\n生活中的例子：\n太阳晒过以后，地上的水坑会慢慢变小，这是蒸发。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade5_plants_need_sunlight_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade5_plants_need_sunlight.md", "grade": "5", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade5_plants_need_sunlight", "tags": ["core", "grade5_plants_need_sunlight", "植物", "阳光"], "text": "# 五年级 植物与阳光\n植物通常需要阳光来制造养分，这个过程叫做光合作用。\n没有足够阳光时，植物可能长得比较慢，叶子发黄，整体不够健康。\n植物除了需要阳光，还需要水、空气和合适的温度。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade4_gravity_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/core/grade4_gravity.md", "grade": "4", "unit": "core", "topic": "grade4_gravity", "tags": ["core", "grade4_gravity", "引力", "重力"], "text": "# 四年级 重力\n重力不是后来才“形成”的按钮，它是物体之间天然会互相吸引的现象；地球很大，所以我们最容易感受到地球把东西往下拉。\n我们平时看到苹果落下来、书本松手后掉到地上、球抛上去又落回来，都是重力在起作用。\n如果没有重力，人和物体就会飘起来，水也不容易留在杯子里。\n月亮也受到地球引力影响，所以它会绕着地球运动，而不是一直飞走。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "grade_explanation_policy_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/policies/grade_explanation_policy.md", "grade": "", "unit": "policies", "topic": "grade_explanation_policy", "tags": ["grade_explanation_policy", "policies"], "text": "# 年级解释规则\n低年级：少术语，多生活例子，句子更短。\n中高年级：可以加入简单术语，但仍需解释清楚。\n所有回答都应先给结论，再分点说明。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "safety_rules_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/policies/safety_rules.md", "grade": "", "unit": "policies", "topic": "safety_rules", "tags": ["policies", "safety_rules"], "text": "# 小学科学安全规则\n涉及火、电、化学反应、锋利工具的实验，不应由学生独自操作。\n所有实验活动应在老师或家长指导下进行。\n如果用户要求危险实验步骤，系统必须拒绝并给出安全替代建议。", "is_experiment": true, "is_safety_related": true}
{"id": "kids_science_shadows_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/extended/kids_science_shadows.txt", "grade": "", "unit": "extended", "topic": "kids_science_shadows", "tags": ["extended", "kids_science_shadows", "影子"], "text": "影子是因为光被物体挡住后形成的暗区。只要有光源、不透明物体和接收影子的地方，通常就能看到影子。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
{"id": "kids_science_evaporation_001", "source": "/Users/Zhuanz/Downloads/science_teacher_demo_pack/kb/raw/extended/kids_science_evaporation.txt", "grade": "", "unit": "extended", "topic": "kids_science_evaporation", "tags": ["extended", "kids_science_evaporation", "蒸发"], "text": "蒸发是液态水慢慢变成水蒸气的过程。晾衣服会变干、水坑会变小，都是蒸发的例子。蒸发通常在有热量的时候更明显，比如太阳出来后。", "is_experiment": false, "is_safety_related": false}
